# shellcheck shell=bash
#
# direnv: enter the flake devShell on cd.
#
# Requires nix-direnv for a usable cache (without it, every cd re-evaluates the
# flake). If `use flake` is slow, that is the tell.
#
# First use in a fresh clone: `direnv allow`.
use flake

# Local, uncommitted overrides (DATABASE_URL, LUXMED_* for the spike, ...).
# dotenv_if_exists keeps this from failing when the file is absent.
dotenv_if_exists .env
